sed to charge a battery for these cameras from a standard electrical outlet. It operates on 100-240VAC power. Its 2-prong US plug goes directly into a wall outlet, so no power cord is required.\"@en-US ","price_right":null,"specTableContent_right":null},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":92,"row":{"pair_id":"9366697#12410846","label":0,"id_left":9366697,"category_left":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_left":10175899,"brand_left":"\"NETGEAR\"@en-US","title_left":" \"Arlo Security System - 2 Wire-Free HD Cameras, Indoor/Outdoor, Night Vision (VMS3230)\"@en-US \"Surveillance Systems | EISF\"@en-US","description_left":"\"Arlo Smart Home Security Cameras are the worldâ€™s ONLY 100% wire-free, HD, Indoor/Outdoor video cameras for home monitoring. Motion activated cameras initiate automatic recording and alert you via email or app notifications. Free apps enable remote monitoring from anywhere and with the built-in night vision youâ€™ll even see in the dark.\"@en-US ","price_left":null,"specTableContent_left":null,"id_right":12410846,"category_right":"Camera_and_Photo","cluster_id_right":72951,"brand_right":"\"\n            Discontinued\n            Uniden\n        \"@en-US","title_right":" \"Uniden Guardian Wireless 4.3 in. Indoor and Outdoor Portable Video Surveillance System with 2 Weatherproof Cameras\"@en-US","description_right":"\"\n                            The Uniden UDR444 digital wireless surveillance video system is easy to set-up and allows you to safely, and discreetly, survey your home or office, even in the darkest and wettest conditions. The 4.3 in. portable hi-res color monitor automatically displays from up to 500 ft., while the two cameras each feature a 40 ft. night vision range with built-in microphones. You can record while you're away by scheduling a recording, choosing to manually record, or by relying on motion sensors. Watch up to 12 hours of recording from the MicroSD card, watch live coverage remotely via Skype.\n                        \"@en-US "